["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人質</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひとじち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">人质</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144195\"><ruby>人質<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとじち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>解放<rp>(</rp><rt>かいほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されるだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The hostages will be released.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">一筋</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひとすじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">一条；一段；一根；一束；一道；一条长度；专一的；坚定的；执着的；一心一意的；一个血脉；一族；普通的；平常的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214524\">スプリンクラーが<ruby>芝生<rp>(</rp><rt>しばふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>一条<rp>(</rp><rt>いちじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>噴出<rp>(</rp><rt>ふんしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The sprinkler is shooting out a stream of water onto the grass.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">人目</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひとめ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">公众注意；他人目光；众人视线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212088\">その<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>塀<rp>(</rp><rt>へい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>人目<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>遮<rp>(</rp><rt>さえぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The house is screened from view with a high fence.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日取り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひどり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">规定日期；指定日期</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97256\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>結婚式<rp>(</rp><rt>けっこんしき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>日取<rp>(</rp><rt>ひど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>繰<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They advanced the wedding date.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">雛</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">雏鸟；小鸟；幼鸟；雏人偶；女儿节人偶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74188\">ムクドリのヒナを<ruby>親鳥<rp>(</rp><rt>おやどり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>返<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Can you return starling chicks to their parents?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日向</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひなた</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">向阳处；阳光下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"122875\"><ruby>日向<rp>(</rp><rt>ひなた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあまり<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くいてはいけません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Don&#x27;t stay in the sun too long.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">避難</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひなん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">躲避；避难；撤离；逃生；寻求庇护</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183485\"><ruby>希望<rp>(</rp><rt>きぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>最後<rp>(</rp><rt>さいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>避難<rp>(</rp><rt>ひなん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>場所<rp>(</rp><rt>ばしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Hope is the last thing that man has to flee unto.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">非難</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひなん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">批评；责备；谴责；抨击；指责</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112544\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>男性<rp>(</rp><rt>だんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みを<ruby>働<rp>(</rp><rt>はたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたことを<ruby>非難<rp>(</rp><rt>ひなん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He blamed the man for stealing.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日の丸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひのまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span clas