uby>えている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I remember the happy days we spent together.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">悲鳴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">尖叫；惨叫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148906\"><ruby>蛇<rp>(</rp><rt>へび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をみたとき、<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>悲鳴<rp>(</rp><rt>ひめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をあげた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She screamed when she saw a snake.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷やかす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひやかす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">嘲笑；戏弄；嘲讽；冷却；冷藏；制冷；橱窗购物；只看不买</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143944\"><ruby>人前<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとまえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>冷<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>やかすなんて<ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>意地悪<rp>(</rp><rt>いじわる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It is mean of you to ridicule him in public.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">日焼け</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひやけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">晒伤；晒黑；晒成褐色；褪色；泛黄；日晒变色；干涸；干枯</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"122865\"><ruby>日焼<rp>(</rp><rt>ひや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けは<ruby>皮膚<rp>(</rp><rt>ひふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をヒリヒリさせる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Sunburn irritates the skin.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">票</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">票；选票；标签；票据；票根</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">標語</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひょうご</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">标语；口号；宣传语</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ひょっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">也许；或许；可能；无意中；不小心；意外地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197441\">ひょっとしたら<ruby>勝<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つかもしれない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I may win by some chance.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">平たい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ひらたい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">平坦；平；平整；（语言）浅显；通俗；简单易懂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tat